@page "/knowmore"

<PageTitle>About Marlon Junio</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-5">
    <!-- Hero Profile Identification Section -->
    <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-gradient mb-2">Marlon Junio</h1>
            <p class="lead text-muted fs-4">Software Engineer / Senior Developer</p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2">
                <span class="badge bg-primary px-3 py-2 fs-6">Dev Since 2019</span>
                <span class="badge bg-dark px-3 py-2 fs-6">Full-Stack Architecture</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Professional Timeline Track Structure -->
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-10 col-lg-8">
            <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4 d-flex align-items-center">
                <span class="bi bi-briefcase-fill me-2 text-primary"></span>
                Professional Experience
            </h2>

            <div class="timeline-wrapper position-relative ps-4 border-start border-2 border-light">

                <!-- Timeline Event 1: Senior Era (NSJBI) -->
                <div class="timeline-item position-relative mb-5">
                    <div class="timeline-dot position-absolute bg-primary rounded-circle" style="width: 12px; height: 12px; left: -22px; top: 8px;"></div>
                    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 bg-white">
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2">
                            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-0">Senior Developer / Programmer</h3>
                            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark fw-normal border">Feb 2025 - Present</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-primary fw-medium mb-2">New San Jose Builders Inc. (NSJBI)</p>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0 small-text">
                            Implemented secure and scalable backend services with SQL Server and stored procedures, ensuring reliable data access and optimized performance across ERP modules. Led end-to-end deployment and configuration of the ERP system with custom domain setup on IIS, adhering to best practices in web hosting, authentication, and application security.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Timeline Event 2: .NET Programmer (SLI Consulting) -->
                <div class="timeline-item position-relative mb-5">
                    <div class="timeline-dot position-absolute bg-secondary rounded-circle" style="width: 12px; height: 12px; left: -22px; top: 8px;"></div>
                    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 bg-white">
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2">
                            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-0">.NET Programmer / Mid Programmer</h3>
                            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark fw-normal border">July 2024 - Jan 2025</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-secondary fw-medium mb-2">SLI Consulting Inc.</p>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0 small-text">
                            Engineered a high-performance web application from scratch, leveraging Razor Pages for dynamic UI and employing best practices in coding, testing, and deployment. Designed and developed Razor Pages applications with Bootstrap for responsive U.I., leveraging SQL Server and stored procedures to ensure secure, efficient, and maintainable database interactions in an Agile Scrum environment.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Timeline Event 3: Software Engineer (Rising Tide Digital) -->
                <div class="timeline-item position-relative mb-5">
                    <div class="timeline-dot position-absolute bg-info rounded-circle" style="width: 12px; height: 12px; left: -22px; top: 8px;"></div>
                    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 bg-white">
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2">
                            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-0">Software Engineer</h3>
                            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark fw-normal border">Oct 2022 - June 2024</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-info fw-medium mb-2">Rising Tide Digital Inc.</p>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0 small-text">
                            Conducted code reviews and provided constructive feedback to team members, ensuring adherence to coding standards. Designed and developed RESTful APIs using JavaScript and Visual Studio, improving data retrieval times by 30%. Utilized SQL and NoSQL databases (e.g., MySQL) to manage and query data effectively, supporting application scalability and performance. Implemented committed project deliverables by writing code, testing, debugging, and deploying releases.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Timeline Event 4: Analyst Programmer (InSiteMy International) -->
                <div class="timeline-item position-relative">
                    <div class="timeline-dot position-absolute bg-muted rounded-circle border" style="width: 12px; height: 12px; left: -22px; top: 8px; background-color: #dee2e6;"></div>
                    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 bg-white">
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2">
                            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-0">Analyst Programmer</h3>
                            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark fw-normal border">June 2020 - Oct 2022</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-success fw-medium mb-2">InSiteMy International Inc.</p>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0 small-text">
                            Designed user interactions on the web application itself while creating servers and databases for the back end of the software. Ensured cross-platform compatibility and optimization. Tested and maintained the responsive design of applications to meet both technical and consumer needs.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

